All,

We have different PVC Collets for the 2G and 3G, 2" fittings.  A PVC Collet=
 is Philmac terminology for a grip ring capable of holding PVC pipe.  It is=
 only used in the IPS-OD Philmac fittings.  The customer buys the fitting a=
nd collet separately and changes out the standard collet for the PVC Collet=
.

Part# for 3G:  75-6898
Part# for 2G:  77-6898

These are not interchangeable.

When a customer is ordering these it must be confirmed the correct collet i=
s being order for the fittings.

Any 75-..... fitting is 3G.

Any 77-.....fitting is 2G

The PVC Collet ordered must have a matching prefix, 75 or 77.

J

--_000_4414AEBBCFB2B648B49E5766D309768E980BD98AF6MAIL_
